    "about": { "text": "Operational carbon per year by element category, from the NRC analytics CSV (source nrc, the samples/nrc folder). The rel.* chain compiles to one SQL statement that runs when rows materializes it. Walls lead at 22854.1 kgCO2e/year, the Q5 answer in the NRC paper." },
